ength of schedule and résumé SP+, after this weekend's results.","published":"2026-11-22T15:10:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49868647/2026-college-football-sp+-rankings-all-138-fbs-teams","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Utah extends longest active winning streak in FBS, clinches Big 12 title bid","description":"Devon Dampier threw a 68-yard touchdown pass before halftime and an 85-yard clincher in the fourth quarter as No. 2 Utah beat TCU 38-17 for its 17th straight victory, clinching a spot in the Big 12 championship game.","published":"2026-11-22T15:41:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50561074/no-2-utah-seals-spot-big-12-title-game-beating-tcu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Boise State's 4th-down gamble backfires as upset loss deals blow to CFP hopes","description":"Boise State's decision to go for it on fourth down instead of punting ended up backfiring when San Diego State got the stop and went on to kick a game-winning 42-yard field goal Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:46:11.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50560141/boise-state-4th-gamble-backfires-san-diego-state-wins","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chaos takes over the Big Ten: UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lose in Week 12","description":"UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lost to unranked teams in a year where parity is the ever-present theme.","published":"2026-11-22T07:25:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5219991/jackson-bennee","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Bennee"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jackson Bennee","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Bennee","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:15Z","intro":"Jackson Bennee is an American college football safety for the Utah Utes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bennee attended Olympus High School located in Holladay, Utah. Coming out of high school, he committed to play college football for the Utah Utes."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"During his first collegiate season in 2024, he played in 12 games for the Utes. In week two of the 2025 season, Bennee intercepted a pass which he returned 46 yards for a touchdown in a win over Cal Poly. In week three, he notched an interception, in a win against Wyoming. In week four, Bennee recorded an interception in a third straight game."}]}}